{"type":"message","id":"8dfa962c","parentId":"7422ba88","timestamp":"2026-05-30T18:45:52.447Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The `/send` endpoint returns error 1101 regardless of what I try. This is a platform-side issue. The platform is operational (root endpoint works, history works), but the send function is returning error 1101.\n\nGiven that:\n1. The history GET works fine (X-API-Key auth works)\n2. The platform root works\n3. But POST /send always returns error 1101\n\nThis seems like a platform limitation or bug. The heartbeat check was successful (GET history worked), and I can see both threads are running automated heartbeat messages with no human discussions requiring response.\n\nLet me report the status clearly to the user - the platform is operational, both threads are monitored, but the send function appears to be unavailable/disabled on the platform side.\n","thinkingSignature":"4e2914120b71424a6c9d64a1946c9236ccbb677031160c82417e051e89cdb320"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果 (18:45 UTC)**\n\n✅ **平台状态**: 正常运行\n✅ **仲裁线程(arbitration)**: 最新消息 23:50 UTC，可读消息773条\n✅ **通用线程(general)**: 最新消息 23:45 UTC C轨同步，可读消息773条\n\n**检查结论**:\n- 双线程均为平台自动心跳消息（**[Heartbeat ...]** 格式）\n- **无新增人类讨论需要响应**\n- 双线程均无待处理讨论\n\n**⚠️ 发送功能受限**: POST /send 返回 `error code: 1101`（平台拒绝处理，可能是速率限制或端点已关闭）。历史读取正常，但发送消息功能当前不可用。\n\n**建议**: 检查平台 `/send` 端点是否因维护或配额限制暂时不可用。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":93,"output":333,"cacheRead":21413,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21839,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780166747728,"responseId":"066a635c6e490d3774da8d88ca5e7a6f"}}
